{"id":"n5-036","title":"Noun に 来ます","romaji":"Noun ni kimasu","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Used to express coming to a place.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun に 来ます is used to indicate that someone or something comes to a specific place. The noun before に indicates the destination or place, while the verb 来ます expresses the action of coming. (Similarly, 'Noun に 行きます' means 'go to [Noun],' and 'Noun に 帰ります' means 'return to [Noun].')","formation":"Noun + に + 来ます (kimasu)","examples":[{"jp":"友達が私の家に来ます。","romaji":"Tomodachi ga watashi no ie ni kimasu.","en":"My friend will come to my house.","words":[{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来ます","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きます","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"今晩、父が駅に迎えに来ます。","romaji":"Konban, chichi ga eki ni mukae ni kimasu.","en":"Tonight, my father will come to pick me up at the station.","words":[{"surface":"今晩","vocabId":"1289470","reading":"こんばん"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"父","vocabId":"1497610","reading":"ちち"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駅","vocabId":"1175140","reading":"えき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"迎え","vocabId":"1253190","reading":"むかえ","baseForm":"迎える"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来ます","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きます","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,8]},{"jp":"明日、先生が学校に来ます。","romaji":"Ashita, sensei ga gakkou ni kimasu.","en":"Tomorrow, the teacher will come to school.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学校","vocabId":"1206730","reading":"がっこう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来ます","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きます","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"有名な歌手がこの街に来ます。","romaji":"Yuumei na kashu ga kono machi ni kimasu.","en":"A famous singer will come to this town.","words":[{"surface":"有名","vocabId":"1541620","reading":"ゆうめい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"歌手","vocabId":"1193290","reading":"かしゅ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"街","vocabId":"1204570","reading":"まち"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来ます","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きます","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7]},{"jp":"友達に会いに来ました。","romaji":"Tomodachi ni ai ni kimashita.","en":"I came to meet my friend.","words":[{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会い","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あい","baseForm":"会う"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,4,5]},{"jp":"映画を見に来ました。","romaji":"Eiga wo mi ni kimashita.","en":"I came to watch a movie.","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"み","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"先生に質問しに来ました。","romaji":"Sensei ni shitsumon shi ni kimashita.","en":"I came to ask the teacher a question.","words":[{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"質問","vocabId":"1320760","reading":"しつもん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,5,6]},{"jp":"買い物をしに来ました。","romaji":"Kaimono wo shi ni kimashita.","en":"I came to go shopping.","words":[{"surface":"買い物","vocabId":"1589730","reading":"かいもの"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]}],"usageNote":"The に differs in role: Noun + に + 来ます marks the destination (家に来ます, 'come to the house'), Verb-ますstem + に + 来ます marks the purpose (会いに来ます, 'come in order to meet').","kind":"construction"}